{"unit_id":"chendefine__dsh-web-search-aggregation#card-zh","repo":"chendefine/dsh-web-search-aggregation","commit":"6db5788775d64abfeb045fc29ba1aad3a0706366","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-aggregation 是面向 DSH web 的网页搜索聚合插件：它将 web_search 接到可排序的队列，并注册 aggregated provider。队列支持 AnySearch、TinyFish、Tavily、Brave、Exa、Firecrawl、Jina、SerpApi 和 Serper；失败时继续尝试后续服务，同一服务可轮换多把密钥。插件设置页可编辑服务顺序、端点和单次超时，保存后新请求采用更新。适合需要多个搜索 API 和备用来源的 DSH 用户。AnySearch 可匿名使用，其余服务需要各自的 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:114-126","src/provider.ts:82-132","src/adapters/index.ts:87-98","src/client/index.ts:79-99","src/defaults.ts:21-30"]}
{"unit_id":"chendefine__dsh-web-search-aggregation#card-en","repo":"chendefine/dsh-web-search-aggregation","commit":"6db5788775d64abfeb045fc29ba1aad3a0706366","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"This DSH web plugin connects web_search to a prioritized queue of search APIs. Failed requests fall through, and keys can rotate across providers. Its settings page edits provider order, endpoints, and timeouts. AnySearch needs no key; other providers require their own API keys.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:114-126","src/provider.ts:82-132","src/adapters/index.ts:87-98","src/client/index.ts:79-99","src/defaults.ts:21-30"]}
