{"unit_id":"chendefine__dsh-web-search-aggregation#feature-1","repo":"chendefine/dsh-web-search-aggregation","commit":"6db5788775d64abfeb045fc29ba1aad3a0706366","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-aggregation 的功能「搜索队列回退」：按设置的顺序请求已启用的搜索源，首个成功结果返回；某个服务失败后继续尝试后续项。搜索由 DSH web_search 流程触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/provider.ts:82-132"]}
